Package: json5
Type: Package
Title: Read and Write 'JSON5' with Comments
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("First", "Last", email = "hannaneh@hangflow.org",
           role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Jeroen", "Ooms", role = "cph",
           comment = "author of 'jsonlite'; clean_names() is adapted from 'jsonlite'"),
    person("Aseem", "Kishore", role = "cph",
           comment = "'json5-tests' conformance suite, see inst/COPYRIGHTS")
  )
Description: A pure R parser and generator for 'JSON5' (<https://spec.json5.org/>).
    'JSON5' adds comments, trailing commas, unquoted keys, single-quoted
    and multi-line strings, hexadecimal numbers, and Infinity and NaN. Text is
    validated against the 'JSON5' 1.0.0 specification and converted to JSON,
    and the mapping between JSON and R objects is done by 'jsonlite'. Comments
    are preserved as R comment() attributes and written back out.
